questions.solution:
**Given:**

Speed1 = 28 kmph, Speed2 = 112 kmph

**Formula used:**

Average speed = dfrac{2 × speed1 × speed2}{speed1 + speed2}

**Calculations:**

Average speed = dfrac{2 × 28 × 112}{28 + 112}

= dfrac{2 × 28 × 112}{140}

= dfrac{224}{5}

= 44.8 kmph

**∴ The answer is 44.8 kmph**
